    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Changes in lifestyle can reduce the risk of diabetes by as much as 50 per cent. Research indicates that by lowering blood sugar levels through diet and exercise, diabetes may be prevented before it develops. People with pre-diabetes could prevent the development of 'type 2' diabetes by modifying their diet and increasing their level of physical activity.",
